  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the fused black and white heaven, a huge transparent pillar falls and kills most of the soul beasts under it. Fairy Zi Wei identifies it as a heavenly pillar and states that each heavenly pillar is a rank nine heaven path immortal material. Ying Wu Xie notes that losing soul-beast concealment still leaves them with a rank nine immortal material.",
