        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly chasm is a rank nine heaven path immortal material of irregular, huge form: formless and ethereal, seeming like empty air yet impassable. It is not overtly lethal, but it blocks passage and forces detours when its shape cannot be mapped.",
